80},"meta":{"digest":"5ff9a99815b824c9a1bced511052cc485832d4889ff9342d25e14c6c9e26a525","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.1/meta.json","size_bytes":6479},"prompt":{"digest":"5dc37042f0433b9250f72b1ac1b6e4085023d1cb3312dd1daebb8ca079b748fd","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.1/prompt.md","size_bytes":182},"state":{"digest":"df58e1c8556538a645d9462255ceea8fbf92aeed8dae810aa97134a970a00fd2","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.1/state.json","size_bytes":180}},"finished_at":null,"global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.1","local_name":"sase-hp.1","metadata":{"agent_clan":"sase-hp","agent_clan_generation":"20260808155416","approve":true,"bead_id":"sase-hp.1","changespec_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","cl_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC sase-hp[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]XPrompt target mode for the prompt input stack[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Editing an existing xprompt definition from the ACE TUI is a [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]first-class, obvious, reliable loop: loading a definition from any [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]surface puts the prompt input widget stack into a visibly distinct [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]\"targeting\" state, <enter> offers a single-keypress \"save to the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]targeted xprompt\" option, and saving writes the correct file [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim](chezmoi source included) and then offers exactly the follow-up [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]actions that file needs — commit/push, a scoped chezmoi apply, or [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the matching `sase memory init` / `sase skill init`.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]7[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]5[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plans:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]xprompt_target_mode.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202608/xprompt_target_mode.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-hp[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-hp/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Targeting model, reference identity, and chezmoi-aware write [/bold #D7AFFF] [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]paths[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]target[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]target: harden XPromptBinding into a full targeting record (canonical [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]reference form, resolved chezmoi write path, apply target, cheap [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]stat-only staleness), add the single target/clear choke point on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]PromptInputBar, and route bound writes through the resolved write path.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Every definition-load surface targets its xprompt[/bold #D7AFFF]             [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]surfaces[dim] · [dim][/dim]after target[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]surfaces: audit every path that loads an xprompt definition into the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]prompt stack, add the missing \"edit definition here\" action to the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]Select XPrompt panel, stop the external-editor round trip from silently [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]dropping the target, and lock the audit down with an invariant test.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Target-aware <enter> chooser with a single-key save[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]menu[dim] · [dim][/dim]after target[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]menu: open the submit chooser whenever the stack is multi-pane or [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]targeted, and add the single-key \"save to the targeted xprompt\" and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]\"save as a new xprompt\" rows with dirty/clean-aware copy.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Post-write follow-up actions with memory and skill init [/bold #D7AFFF]      [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n      [bold #D7AFFF]integration[/bold #D7AFFF]\n    [#AF87FF]followup[dim] · [dim][/dim]after target[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]followup: replace the single commit/push confirmation with a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]classifier-driven follow-up chooser that offers commit/push, a scoped [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]chezmoi apply, `sase memory init`, or `sase skill init` — whichever [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]actually apply to the written file — and runs them through the tracked [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]task queue.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Visual language for the targeting state[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]visual[dim] · [dim][/dim]after target, menu[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]visual: give the targeting state a deliberate, theme-safe look — [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]distinct bar border, a reference chip with clean/dirty/read-only/stale [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]states, matching frontmatter panel tint, subtitle and footer hints — and[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pin it with PNG snapshot goldens.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Help modal, footer, and documentation[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after surfaces, menu, followup, visual[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: bring the `?` help popup, the conditional keybinding footer, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the ACE / xprompt documentation in line with the new targeting keys and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]save flow.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]End-to-end verification of the edit loop[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after docs[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]verify: run the full verification gate and drive the real TUI through [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the complete loop for a plain xprompt, a memory note, and a skill [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]source, including the chezmoi path.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-hp","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-5.5","phase_bead_id":"sase-hp.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-9eda359e8fc0ed45644804412ef73f2d","started_at":"2026-08-08T19:54:29.306281+00:00","state":"active"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":[],"restartable":true},"commits":[{"committed_at":1786231921,"sha":"65f82ccd9f52946f2633b7aa0d986cefc7732858","subject":"docs(ace): document xprompt targeting/save-flow entry points and fix stale help text"}],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"3b86e292ecb1c86ebf581165a977436e329c7dbf2430d1d1bc2f1a2d4da8f932","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.6/chat.md","size_bytes":6371},"commits":{"digest":"36e782e4528683d7cc340a5ba7a255b847bf3f506efaff3e1e981f4034a9cc6f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.6/commits.json","size_bytes":262},"embedded_workflows":{"digest":"a398c70160fe308637edd70b38d8cf02cc697183c480675d10f387d529663058","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.6/embedded_workflows.json","size_bytes":80},"meta":{"digest":"42c0e9e3b05d790ec244956e68956e51fa6c908894db9fcc88e4ea20de632e6f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.6/meta.json","size_bytes":701},"prompt":{"digest":"baf0e4dd6d02710216253a290d9d798396650fe6c43103b5bdff5b5be5c5d0cc","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.sase-hp.6/prompt.md","s